      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>While moogle legends describe Moggle Mog as a kind, benevolent presence, the primal summoned by Mooglesguard is driven by the need to feast on ever-greater amounts of aether along with a large following to further solidify his being. - Moggle Mog</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 21, touch 17, flat-footed 16 (+1 size, +5 dex, +1 dodge, +4 natural)</p><p>HP 110 [169] (13d10+39)</p><p>Fort +7, Ref +13, Will +17</p><p>Weakness Shadow</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 20 ft., fly 30 ft. (good)</p><p>Ranged Double Charged Fire Staff +20/+15/+10 (2d6+9/x2 fire damage)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>STR 8, DEX 20, CON 16, INT 28, WIS 24, CHA 12</p><p>Base Atk +13; CMB +11; CMD +26</p><p>Feats Advanced Power Weapons Wielder, Dodge, Improved Iron Will, Improved Power Weapons Wielder, Iron Will, Skill Focus (Fly), Weapon Focus (Power Staff)</p><p>Skills Fly +31</p><p>SQ Outsider traits, Does not Breathe, Does not Eat, Does not Sleep</p>"
